{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#card-zh","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness 的中文插件：在 agent/pre-step 首步向会话加入 system-reminder，要求模型以简体中文进行推理和最终回答，并让计划、工具调用、总结和代码注释也使用中文。遇到 dsh-liangshen 会话时，它识别对应的 prompt section，将同一指令幂等地追加到 persona，避免过滤后丢失或重复注入。插件通过 cordis.patch.yml 挂载，不提供额外命令或设置。适合希望 DSH 默认使用简体中文交流的用户；模型语言由提示词引导。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-12","lib/index.js:41-81","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#card-en","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning guides DeepSeek Harness to reason and reply in Simplified Chinese. It adds a reminder on the first agent step and appends it to persona sections in dsh-liangshen sessions, where it avoids duplicate injection. Mounted through cordis.patch.yml; no extra commands or settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-12","lib/index.js:41-81","cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
