{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#feature-1","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning 的功能「首步中文指令」：每个会话首个 agent/pre-step 阶段向消息追加 system-reminder，要求推理、回答及计划等内容使用简体中文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-12","lib/index.js:59-80"]}
{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#feature-2","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning 的功能「梁神模式兼容」：检测 system prompt 中的 dsh-liangshen section 后，将中文提醒幂等追加到 persona section，让指令在该模式过滤后仍保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-39","lib/index.js:41-57"]}
{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#feature-3","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning 的功能「避免重复提醒」：识别已记录的梁神模式会话；persona 已含中文指令时不再追加，并跳过后续首步消息注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-56","lib/index.js:65-68"]}
{"unit_id":"zhy201810576__dsh-zh-reasoning#feature-4","repo":"zhy201810576/dsh-zh-reasoning","commit":"272a003965518da53adc23ba3ae71791e0c2de26","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh-reasoning 的功能「保留下游决策字段」：首步注入时展开原 decision 并追加消息，因此已有的 startsRequestSeries 等字段不会因重建决策对象而丢失。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:69-80"]}
